cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "binderscope: structure-aware triage of protein binder designs"
abstract: >-
  A post-processing pipeline for protein binder design campaigns. Restores an
  engineered design target to wild type before scoring, computes interface
  metrics with PyRosetta, measures where the binder sits relative to a
  reference structure, ranks designs on explicit weighted criteria, and renders
  a self-contained interactive dashboard. All target-specific parameters are
  configuration, so a run is reproducible from a single YAML file.
